\paragraph{Cross-environment validation.} We include \textbf{Cheetah Run} (17D observations, 6D actions) to test whether the identified mechanisms generalize beyond Walker Walk.\footnote{Cheetah Run baseline is in progress at the time of submission (010a, 116K/512K steps).}

